### Generate 10 Charging Port parts

### 1. Add Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra Charging Port Flex (Phone)
POST {{host}}{{part_mapping}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{staff_auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

950.00
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="quantity"

40
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Samsung Galaxy S23 Ultra USB-C Charging Port Flex Cable
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="specifications"

Original Type-C dock connector with microphone
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="manufacturerId"

1
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceTypeId"

3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partTypeId"

6
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceModels"

SM-S918B
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="partImage"; filename="charging_port01.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./assets/part_image/charging_port01.jpg

--WebAppBoundary--

